  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1766009411_2850836_e0b8551627b22ba9df7d35b63a090f9f.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span><strong>The Aeon Teä Partner Guide</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>At Aeon Tea, we believe wellness shouldn’t feel like a chore, it should be a ritual you actually look forward to. We source high-quality, organic ingredients to create blends that don't just <strong>\"do good\"</strong> for your body, but actually taste incredible. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>From our <strong>Golden Warmth: </strong>ginger, turmeric and peppercorn blends to our calming evening teas, everything we make is designed to bring a little bit of clarity and balance to a busy day.  We’re a small team obsessed with quality, and we’re looking for people who care about what they put in their bodies as much as we do.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;min-height:18px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span><strong>The Power of the Pause</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>We aren’t your average <strong>\"tea bag in a box\"</strong> company. To us, tea is more than a drink; it’s an invitation to slow down:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>• <strong>A Tool for Self-Care:</strong> In a world that’s always <strong>\"on,\" </strong>we advocate for the intentional pause. Our blends are crafted to be the centerpiece of your daily self-care ritual that 10-minute window where the phone is away and you’re checking in with yourself.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>• <strong>Building Connections:</strong> Some of the best conversations happen over a warm cup. Whether it’s catching up with a partner or sharing a pot with a friend, Aeon Teä is about fostering those genuine, screen-free connections with the people who matter most.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>• <strong>Whole Ingredients:</strong> We focus on <strong>the </strong><em><strong>experience, </strong></em>the scent, the color, and the feeling. We don't hide behind \"natural flavorings\"; <strong>we use real, whole ingredients you can actually see.</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;min-height:17px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span><strong>How you’ll earn:</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>We want our partners to grow alongside us. For every sale you refer, you’ll earn a <strong>12% commission.</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>• <strong>30-Day:</strong> We use a 30-day \"cookie\" window. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span><strong>How to promote us:</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>The best way to share Aeon Teä is to show how it fits into your life. We love seeing:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>• <strong>The Morning Reset:</strong> A \"Get Ready With Me\" featuring your favorite blend to start the day with intention.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>• <strong>Quality Time:</strong> Capturing a moment of connection—sharing a cup with a loved one or a friend.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>• <strong>Self-Care Sunday:</strong> Sharing how you use tea to decompress and recharge your own battery.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;min-height:17px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span><strong>The \"Need to Know\" details:</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>• <strong>Community First:</strong> We aren't looking for<strong> \"billboard\"</strong> affiliates. We’re looking for storytellers. If you love the product, the content will feel natural.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><span>• <strong>Support:</strong> You’ll have a direct line to us. If you need specific assets, brand photos, we will have these for you.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;font:15px 'Helvetica Neue';color:#000000;\"><br></p></div>",
